					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 2: SAMPLE & HOLD PLAYBACK\n\nIn this example we've used a Metronome, Sine and Snapshot node to create a sample & hold circuit.\nThie data from the sample & hold is then used as the phase of the Video Sampler."
					}
